      "content": "that's a good start. i'm interested in the biological mechanisms behind those distinctions. when we look at the divergence in social cohesion or risk-taking between, say, certain sub-saharan african lineages versus northern european populations, is there any consensus in the literature regarding specific alleles or neurobiological pathways that might be driving these differences? i want to look at the more \"hard\" genetic evidence rather than just cultural factors.",
